    "projectDescriptionEn": "<p>Establishing a market located on the intersection between AlBatha Street and Southern Ring Road in Al Aziziya District, Riyadh. The market spans 25,000 square meters and includes 8 buildings comprising 154 rental units (offices and shops). The market specializes in the retail and wholesale of dates.</p>\r\n",
